{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7669686673517906229","title":"前端开发工程师 - 飞书","description":"团队介绍：飞书是字节跳动旗下 AI 工作平台，面向人与agent协作，提供一站式协同办公、组织管理、业务提效工具和深入企业场景的 AI 能力，让 AI 真能用真落地。\n从互联网、高科技、消费零售到制造、金融、医疗健康，各行各业先进企业都在飞书落地AI，与飞书共创行业最佳实践。先进团队，AI用飞书。\n\n1、参与飞书音视频会议及智能会议产品的前端研发，建设实时字幕、智能纪要、妙记等核心体验；\n2、基于React、Electron等技术参与桌面端与Web端工程建设，持续优化复杂交互、性能和稳定性；\n3、与产品、设计及算法团队协作，将AI能力转化为易用、可信赖的办公体验。","requirement":"1、2027届获得本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程等相关专业优先；\n2、掌握JavaScript/TypeScript、HTML、CSS、DOM、网络协议等前端基础；\n3、了解React等主流框架，具备良好的设计与编码能力；\n4、学习与动手能力强，关注AI技术发展，重视验证与结果质量；有AI项目或开源实践者加分。","job_category":{"id":"6704215886108035339","name":"前端","en_name":"Frontend","i18n_name":"前端","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"6704215862603155720","name":"研发","en_name":"R\u0026D","i18n_name":"研发","depth":1,"children":[]},"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","i18n_name":"上海"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785738160037,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A42681","job_id":"7668348062867573045","city_list":[{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],